# SCM「生成提交信息」（闪电图标）专用约定
# 说明：Cursor Source Control 的生成提交信息只读取本文件，不读 .cursor/rules / User Rules。

When generating a Git commit message for this repository:
- Use Simplified Chinese for the description (type/scope may stay in English)
- Format: type(scope): 中文描述
- type must be one of: feat|fix|refactor|docs|chore|style|test|perf|build|ci
- Never add Co-authored-by / Co-Authored-By or any AI/tool attribution lines

## Specificity (required)
- Do NOT write vague one-liners like「优化代码」「修复问题」「更新配置」「调整样式」
- Subject line must name the concrete change: which module/page/API/behavior, and what became different
- Prefer: 文件/功能点 + 动作 + 结果（例如「嵌入模式关闭侧栏与登录页重定向」）
- If the staged diff touches multiple concerns, add a body with 2–5 bullets, each stating one concrete change from the diff
- Base the message on the actual diff; do not invent changes that are not in the staged files
- Keep subject under ~72 characters; put detail in the body rather than making the subject abstract

## Good examples
- feat(frontend): 首页嵌入模式隐藏布局侧栏并禁用登录页跳转
- fix(auth): 刷新令牌过期后清除本地会话并跳转登录页
- refactor(dashboard): remAdapt 按容器宽度重算根字号，避免 iframe 裁切

## Bad examples (never generate these)
- chore: 更新代码
- fix: 修复 bug
- feat(frontend): 优化用户体验
